WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.725 --> 00:00:18.635
&gt;&gt; Laura: I AM LAURA INGRAHAM,

00:00:18.636 --> 00:00:19.269
AND THIS IS

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.270
"THE INGRAHAM ANGLE."

00:00:20.271 --> 00:00:21.638
THERE ARE TWO THINGS THAT HANG

00:00:21.639 --> 00:00:22.939
IN THE BALANCE.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:25.242
AN ECONOMY AS EVIDENCED BY

00:00:25.243 --> 00:00:26.677
TODAY'S JOB REPORT.

00:00:26.678 --> 00:00:28.045
IT'S ROARING, MY FRIENDS.

00:00:28.046 --> 00:00:29.813
AND IN IMMIGRATION POLICY THAT

00:00:29.814 --> 00:00:31.248
MAKES SENSE.

00:00:31.249 --> 00:00:32.416
MY SIMPLE MESSAGE IS THIS.

00:00:32.417 --> 00:00:43.226
LET'S NOT STOP SUCCESS, AMERICA

00:00:43.227 --> 00:00:46.396
AND, I'M TALKING ABOUT PEOPLE

00:00:46.397 --> 00:00:55.605
WITH DIFFERENT RACES, AND THEY

00:00:55.606 --> 00:00:58.875
ARE DECIDING THE NECK AND NECK

00:00:58.876 --> 00:01:00.344
RACE HERE BETWEEN MARTHA

00:01:00.345 --> 00:01:00.944
McSALLY REPUBLICAN AND

00:01:00.945 --> 00:01:02.612
DEMOCRAT KYRSTEN SINEMA.

00:01:02.613 --> 00:01:04.247
WE WILL TALK TO MAKE SALLY JUST

00:01:04.248 --> 00:01:06.683
AHEAD BUT FIRST WE WANTED TO

00:01:06.684 --> 00:01:09.252
HEAR FROM THE VOTERS THEMSELVES.

00:01:09.253 --> 00:01:10.554
WE START WITH THE PRESSING ISSUE

00:01:10.555 --> 00:01:13.223
OF IMMIGRATION AND HOW ILLEGALS

00:01:13.224 --> 00:01:14.658
HAVE AFFECTED THIS BORDER STATE.

00:01:14.659 --> 00:01:16.927
RAYMOND ARROYO JOINS ME FOR THE

00:01:16.928 --> 00:01:18.829
QUESTIONING OF THIS GROUP.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:19.496
HERE'S PART ONE.

00:01:19.497 --> 00:01:21.031
I WANT TO BEGIN WITH AN ISSUE

00:01:21.032 --> 00:01:23.300
THAT'S FRONT AND CENTER RIGHT

00:01:23.301 --> 00:01:24.835
NOW, AND THUS THE ISSUE OF

00:01:24.836 --> 00:01:26.103
IMMIGRATION.

00:01:26.104 --> 00:01:29.673
THERE ARE MULTIPLE CARAVANS

00:01:29.674 --> 00:01:31.308
BARRELING TOWARD OUR BORDER, AND

00:01:31.309 --> 00:01:33.844
A LOT OF THE MIGRANTS COULD END

00:01:33.845 --> 00:01:34.811
UP IN YOUR BACKYARD.

00:01:34.812 --> 00:01:37.848
HOW MANY OF YOU THINK YOU SHOULD

00:01:37.849 --> 00:01:39.082
WELCOME ALL MEMBER OF THE

00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:40.450
CARAVAN DESPITE EVIDENCE THAT

00:01:40.451 --> 00:01:41.852
THERE ARE CRIMINALS WITHIN THE

00:01:41.853 --> 00:01:43.019
GROUP.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:46.022
RAISE YOUR HAND.

00:01:46.023 --> 00:01:46.757
ALL MEMBERS OF THE CARAVAN.

00:01:46.758 --> 00:01:49.459
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK THERE'S

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:50.293
CRIMINALS IN THE GROUP.

00:01:50.294 --> 00:01:53.096
&gt;&gt; YOU DON'T THINK THERE ARE ANY

00:01:53.097 --> 00:01:53.830
CRIMINALS?

00:01:53.831 --> 00:01:55.165
&gt;&gt; I THINK THERE ARE WOMEN AND

00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:57.434
CHILDREN WHO ARE TRYING TO GET

00:01:57.435 --> 00:01:58.769
AWAY FROM FEAR AND MILITARY

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:01.671
DICTATORS AND ALL KINDS OF OTHER

00:02:01.672 --> 00:02:03.507
PROBLEMS IN THEIR COUNTRIES.

00:02:03.508 --> 00:02:06.643
&gt;&gt; ACTUALLY, GRIFF JENKINS WITH

00:02:06.644 --> 00:02:07.944
OUR CORRESPONDENT DOWN, AND HE'S

00:02:07.945 --> 00:02:09.179
BEEN WITH THE CARAVAN FOR A

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:11.848
NUMBER OF DAYS.

00:02:11.849 --> 00:02:13.316
HE INTERVIEWED VARIOUS MEMBERS

00:02:13.317 --> 00:02:15.719
OF THE CARAVAN AND THIS IS WHAT

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:16.453
HE FOUND OUT LAST SUNDAY.

00:02:16.454 --> 00:02:18.855
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU WILLING TO BREAK THE

00:02:18.856 --> 00:02:20.090
LAW TO GET BACK TO THE

00:02:20.091 --> 00:02:20.557
UNITED STATES?

00:02:20.558 --> 00:02:23.093
&gt;&gt; HE SAID HE WANTS TO APPLY FOR

00:02:23.094 --> 00:02:24.861
A PARDON FOR THE FELONY HE

00:02:24.862 --> 00:02:26.830
COMMITTED.

00:02:26.831 --> 00:02:31.168
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU ASK HIM HAPPENED?

00:02:31.169 --> 00:02:38.608
&gt;&gt; A THIRD-DEGREE FELONY.

00:02:38.609 --> 00:02:40.076
ATTEMPT OF MURDER.

00:02:40.077 --> 00:02:41.578
&gt;&gt; DAN, YOUR REACTION?

00:02:41.579 --> 00:02:43.113
&gt;&gt; MY REACTION IS THAT MOST OF

00:02:43.114 --> 00:02:44.080
THESE WOMEN, CHILDREN AND

00:02:44.081 --> 00:02:45.582
FAMILIES ARE COMING HERE FOR

00:02:45.583 --> 00:02:47.517
ASYLUM AND DOING AT THE RIGHT

00:02:47.518 --> 00:02:47.784
WAY.

00:02:47.785 --> 00:02:50.187
YOU HAVE TO GO TO A PORT OF

00:02:50.188 --> 00:02:50.954
ENTRY, YOU HAVE TO TURN YOURSELF

00:02:50.955 --> 00:02:52.789
IN AT A PORT OF ENTRY AND YOU

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:55.692
HAVE TO APPLY FOR ASYLUM.

00:02:55.693 --> 00:02:58.829
IF THEY DON'T FIT ASYLUM, THEN

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.864
YOU HAVE TO GO BACK.

00:03:00.865 --> 00:03:03.867
IF THEY MEET THE CRITERIA FOR

00:03:03.868 --> 00:03:05.735
ASYLUM, THEY ARE NOT BREAKING

00:03:05.736 --> 00:03:06.136
THE LAW.

00:03:06.137 --> 00:03:12.442
&gt;&gt;   HOW DO YOU THINK WOMEN FEEL

00:03:12.443 --> 00:03:13.009
ABOUT THE CARAVAN?

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.245
&gt;&gt; I DON'T WANT THEM IN OUR

00:03:15.246 --> 00:03:15.946
COUNTRY AND WOMEN DON'T WANT

00:03:15.947 --> 00:03:20.717
THEM IN OUR COUNTRY.

00:03:20.718 --> 00:03:21.284
WOMEN WANT SECURITY.

00:03:21.285 --> 00:03:23.987
&gt;&gt; I SAW YOU NODDING YOUR HEAD

00:03:23.988 --> 00:03:25.589
OR SHAKING HER HEAD A MINUTE

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:25.856
AGO.

00:03:25.857 --> 00:03:28.558
&gt;&gt; I DON'T CARE IF NOBODY IS A

00:03:28.559 --> 00:03:28.925
CRIMINAL.

00:03:28.926 --> 00:03:29.593
HAVE SOME RESPECT FOR THIS

00:03:29.594 --> 00:03:33.163
COUNTRY AND DO WITH THE LEGAL

00:03:33.164 --> 00:03:33.563
WAY.

00:03:33.564 --> 00:03:34.764
I'M A LIFELONG DEMOCRAT, I

00:03:34.765 --> 00:03:36.466
SWITCHED OVER FOR TRUMP JUST TO

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:38.034
VOTE FOR HIM.

00:03:38.035 --> 00:03:43.640
I'VE ALWAYS VOTE FOR HIM.

00:03:43.641 --> 00:03:45.675
THEY ARE SUFFERING EVERYWHERE IN

00:03:45.676 --> 00:03:46.243
THE WORLD.

00:03:46.244 --> 00:03:47.244
CHARITY STARTS AT HOME, LET'S

00:03:47.245 --> 00:03:49.513
TAKE CARE OF OUR OWN FIRST AND

00:03:49.514 --> 00:03:49.880
FOREMOST.

00:03:49.881 --> 00:03:54.251
THEN WE DO WITH THE LEGAL WAY,

00:03:54.252 --> 00:03:55.118
NOT ILLEGALLY.

00:03:55.119 --> 00:03:58.255
&gt;&gt; I SEE ROY SITTING NEXT TO

00:03:58.256 --> 00:03:59.789
TERRY, CHOMPING AT THE BIT.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.057
&gt;&gt; TRUMP SAYS IT WHEN THEY DON'T

00:04:01.058 --> 00:04:03.159
WANT THE CARAVAN TO COME IN, I'M

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.895
SURE A NUMBER OF WOMEN WOULDN'T

00:04:04.896 --> 00:04:06.162
WANT TO BE AROUND DONALD TRUMP.

00:04:06.163 --> 00:04:09.299
BUT FIRST AND FOREMOST, I WOULD

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:11.101
SAY, LET'S GO THROUGH THE

00:04:11.102 --> 00:04:11.434
PROCESS.

00:04:11.435 --> 00:04:14.437
LET'S PROCESS EACH CASE, CASE BY

00:04:14.438 --> 00:04:14.838
CASE.

00:04:14.839 --> 00:04:16.306
IF THERE WAS A PROPER SYSTEM OF

00:04:16.307 --> 00:04:18.141
IMMIGRATION IN PLACE THEN WE

00:04:18.142 --> 00:04:18.842
COULD PROPERLY VET THOSE THAT

00:04:18.843 --> 00:04:22.479
WERE TRYING TO ENTER INTO THE

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:24.648
COUNTRY AND DECIPHER WHO WAS A

00:04:24.649 --> 00:04:27.050
CRIMINAL AND WHO WAS SEEKING

00:04:27.051 --> 00:04:28.385
ASYLUM.

00:04:28.386 --> 00:04:31.054
&gt;&gt; JULIE, HE WANTED TO SAY WHAT?

00:04:31.055 --> 00:04:33.156
&gt;&gt; THERE IS A SYSTEM AND HOW TO

00:04:33.157 --> 00:04:34.090
COME TO THIS COUNTRY.

00:04:34.091 --> 00:04:35.625
I'M AN IMMIGRANT AND I DID AT

00:04:35.626 --> 00:04:37.060
THE RIGHT WAY.

00:04:37.061 --> 00:04:39.029
YOU FILE YOUR PAPERWORK, GET

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.297
APPROVED AND COME HERE.

00:04:40.298 --> 00:04:43.466
IT'S AS SIMPLE AS THAT.

00:04:43.467 --> 00:04:45.902
&gt;&gt; HERE'S THE PROBLEM.

00:04:45.903 --> 00:04:48.038
RIGHT NOW OUR SYSTEM IS BEING

00:04:48.039 --> 00:04:48.438
GAMED.

00:04:48.439 --> 00:04:49.439
THE ASYLUM SYSTEM, IT'S A GOOD

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:53.677
THING TO ALLOW PEOPLE IN FOR

00:04:53.678 --> 00:04:55.111
ASYLUM FOR CERTAIN CREDIBLE

00:04:55.112 --> 00:04:56.079
FEARS.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:59.015
FEAR OF RELIGIOUS PERSECUTION,

00:04:59.016 --> 00:05:02.218
ETHNIC CLEANSING, TRUE FEAR OF

00:05:02.219 --> 00:05:03.153
PERSECUTION FOR POLITICAL

00:05:03.154 --> 00:05:05.455
OUTLOOK.

00:05:05.456 --> 00:05:06.356
BUT -- AND WE HAVE THE MEXICAN

00:05:06.357 --> 00:05:08.658
AMBASSADOR AND GUATEMALAN

00:05:08.659 --> 00:05:09.359
INTERIOR ON LAST NIGHT ON THE

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:12.629
ANGLE AND THEY BOTH SAID THAT

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:13.296
MOST OF THESE MIGRANTS

00:05:13.297 --> 00:05:14.965
OVERWHELMINGLY ARE ECONOMIC.

00:05:14.966 --> 00:05:16.099
THEY ARE COMING BECAUSE LIKE

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:16.800
HUNDREDS OF MILLIONS OF PEOPLE

00:05:16.801 --> 00:05:22.339
AROUND THE WORLD, IT'S A GREAT

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.373
PLACE TO LIVE.

00:05:23.374 --> 00:05:29.079
AND THEY WANT TO COME HERE.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:29.846
&gt;&gt; WHAT THE MEDIA ISN'T SHOWING

00:05:29.847 --> 00:05:31.081
IS THEY ARE PASSING LIVE FEEDS

00:05:31.082 --> 00:05:34.084
OF WHAT'S HAPPENING IN MEXICO

00:05:34.085 --> 00:05:35.218
WITH THIS CARAVAN.

00:05:35.219 --> 00:05:39.155
THE CARAVAN IS ASSAULTING POLICE

00:05:39.156 --> 00:05:40.657
OFFICERS, AND THEY ARE TEARING

00:05:40.658 --> 00:05:42.692
APART THE COUNTRY OF MEXICO.

00:05:42.693 --> 00:05:44.160
YOU HAVE PEOPLE THEY ARE, THE

00:05:44.161 --> 00:05:45.562
OWN MEXICAN RESIDENTS THAT ARE

00:05:45.563 --> 00:05:46.229
LIVING THERE.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:48.231
THEY ARE SAYING GO BACK TO YOUR

00:05:48.232 --> 00:05:50.834
COUNTRY AND STOP TEARING APART

00:05:50.835 --> 00:05:51.167
HOURS.

00:05:51.168 --> 00:05:52.702
&gt;&gt; BUT THEY WERE ALSO HAVING A

00:05:52.703 --> 00:05:55.038
GOOD TIME AND BE WELCOME IN

00:05:55.039 --> 00:05:55.872
DIFFERENT PARTS OF THE

00:05:55.873 --> 00:05:56.239
COMMUNITY.

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:57.741
&gt;&gt; BUT THEY ARE TAKING THIS

00:05:57.742 --> 00:06:01.277
MIND-SET AND BRINGING IT DOWN TO

00:06:01.278 --> 00:06:03.279
THIS BORDER.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.415
&gt;&gt; I'M AN IMMIGRANT TO THIS

00:06:05.416 --> 00:06:07.584
COUNTRY AND I CAME HERE LEGALLY.

00:06:07.585 --> 00:06:09.419
IT TOOK ME TEN YEARS TO GET MY

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.154
CITIZENSHIP AND I ALSO WORKED IN

00:06:11.155 --> 00:06:12.389
THE HEALTH CARE INDUSTRY.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:13.923
THEY LOOK AT THIS CARAVAN AND

00:06:13.924 --> 00:06:15.825
THIS IS AN ORGANIZED GROUP.

00:06:15.826 --> 00:06:18.028
I REALLY FEEL IT'S AN INVASION

00:06:18.029 --> 00:06:19.229
OF OUR COUNTRY.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.465
THIS IS AN ORGANIZED CARAVAN AND

00:06:22.466 --> 00:06:23.433
PEOPLE HAVE TRUCKS AND ARE

00:06:23.434 --> 00:06:24.668
HAULING PEOPLE ON THE FREEWAY

00:06:24.669 --> 00:06:25.835
AND THEN THEY LOOK AT THE

00:06:25.836 --> 00:06:27.904
CARAVAN AND THEY ARE FINDING

00:06:27.905 --> 00:06:30.874
THAT 80% OF IT ARE MEN.

00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:34.077
AND LESS THAN 20% ARE WOMEN AND

00:06:34.078 --> 00:06:34.444
CHILDREN.

00:06:34.445 --> 00:06:36.646
&gt;&gt; THE OFFICIALS THAT ARE

00:06:36.647 --> 00:06:38.782
MONITORING THIS, THE MEXICAN

00:06:38.783 --> 00:06:39.916
OFFICIALS AND THE GUATEMALAN

00:06:39.917 --> 00:06:43.153
OFFICIALS THAT WE TALK TO AND

00:06:43.154 --> 00:06:44.287
INTERVIEWED HAVE CONFIRMED THAT

00:06:44.288 --> 00:06:46.856
THEY ARE OVERWHELMINGLY

00:06:46.857 --> 00:06:49.225
ABLE-BODIED WORKING AGE MEN.

00:06:49.226 --> 00:06:51.194
WOMEN AND CHILDREN BEING PUT IN

00:06:51.195 --> 00:06:55.265
THE FRONT AND ALMOST LIKE A

00:06:55.266 --> 00:06:57.467
HUMAN SHIELD.

00:06:57.468 --> 00:06:59.235
NO MATTER WHAT PEOPLE THINK

00:06:59.236 --> 00:07:01.271
ABOUT IMMIGRATION, THAT'S FINE.

00:07:01.272 --> 00:07:02.806
BUT IT'S NOT IMMIGRATION AND

00:07:02.807 --> 00:07:05.442
THAT'S A FACT.

00:07:05.443 --> 00:07:07.077
YOU ARE ALL FROM DIFFERENT

00:07:07.078 --> 00:07:07.711
BACKGROUNDS AND POLITICAL

00:07:07.712 --> 00:07:08.845
PERSUASIONS, HOW MANY OF YOU

00:07:08.846 --> 00:07:12.982
OBJECT TO THE WORD INVASION?

00:07:12.983 --> 00:07:14.684
SO THAT'S ABOUT HALF.

00:07:14.685 --> 00:07:19.222
HOW MANY OBJECT TO THE USE OF

00:07:19.223 --> 00:07:22.525
THE WORD INVASION ARE DEMOCRATS.

00:07:22.526 --> 00:07:23.259
RAISE YOUR HAND.

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:24.227
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE COMING HERE WITH

00:07:24.228 --> 00:07:33.570
THEIR OWN FLAG, WAVING THEIR OWN

00:07:33.571 --> 00:07:35.038
FLAG, IT'S AN INVASION.

00:07:35.039 --> 00:07:39.242
&gt;&gt; I'M SORRY, IT'S AN INVASION.

00:07:39.243 --> 00:07:41.878
YOU WANT TO COME TO THIS

00:07:41.879 --> 00:07:42.212
COUNTRY?

00:07:42.213 --> 00:07:46.483
DON'T BURN OUR FLAG.

00:07:46.484 --> 00:07:47.217
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT.

00:07:47.218 --> 00:07:49.986
&gt;&gt; DO I NEED TO SEPARATE YOU

00:07:49.987 --> 00:07:50.253
TWO?

00:07:50.254 --> 00:07:53.123
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE TO GIVE EVERYBODY A

00:07:53.124 --> 00:07:53.556
POINT HERE.

00:07:53.557 --> 00:07:56.159
&gt;&gt; IN TERMS OF BEING ORGANIZED,

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.761
HOW IS THAT DIFFERENT FROM

00:07:57.762 --> 00:07:59.229
CARAVANS OF BOATS THAT CAME OVER

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:02.899
WITH WHAT WE CALL PILGRIMS WHICH

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:03.633
WERE SIMPLY EUROPEAN REFUGEES?

00:08:03.634 --> 00:08:06.870
HOW IS THAT ANY DIFFERENT?

00:08:06.871 --> 00:08:08.271
YOU ARE TALKING ABOUT CARAVANS

00:08:08.272 --> 00:08:09.706
AND INVASIONS, BUT WE ARE NOT

00:08:09.707 --> 00:08:14.611
TALKING ABOUT WHAT IS THE

00:08:14.612 --> 00:08:16.679
ORIGINAL INVASION OF WHERE WE

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:16.946
SIT?

00:08:16.947 --> 00:08:20.083
WE ARE ON INVADED LAND, THAT WE

00:08:20.084 --> 00:08:21.651
INVADED.

00:08:21.652 --> 00:08:22.452
WELL, NOT I.

00:08:22.453 --> 00:08:23.086
NOT ALIVE.

00:08:23.087 --> 00:08:24.721
BUT PEOPLE THAT LOOK LIKE ME

00:08:24.722 --> 00:08:27.090
INVADED THIS LAND.

00:08:27.091 --> 00:08:29.225
&gt;&gt; Laura: HOW MANY HERE

00:08:29.226 --> 00:08:31.594
BELIEVE THAT IN PART, THESE

00:08:31.595 --> 00:08:33.963
CARAVANS HAVE A POLITICAL

00:08:33.964 --> 00:08:35.698
MOTIVATION IN THE ORGANIZATION?

00:08:35.699 --> 00:08:42.138
RAISE YOUR HAND.

00:08:42.139 --> 00:08:44.107
&gt;&gt; &gt;&gt; I JUST WANT TO HEARKEN

00:08:44.108 --> 00:08:47.610
BACK TO WHAT YOU SAID, AND WHAT

00:08:47.611 --> 00:08:48.778
THAT GENTLEMAN SAID IS PROBABLY

00:08:48.779 --> 00:08:49.078
TRUE.

00:08:49.079 --> 00:08:51.948
BEEN GAMING THE SYSTEM EVER

00:08:51.949 --> 00:08:53.416
SINCE WE ARRIVED BY THE

00:08:53.417 --> 00:08:54.450
MAYFLOWER, AND THAT'S WHY I

00:08:54.451 --> 00:08:57.654
THINK WE HAVE THE SYSTEM.

00:08:57.655 --> 00:08:59.889
I GOT HERE IN 1969 AND I'VE BEEN

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.992
HEARING THE SAME STORY OVER AND

00:09:02.993 --> 00:09:03.626
OVER AGAIN.

00:09:03.627 --> 00:09:05.361
I THINK WE NEED TO TAKE THE RULE

00:09:05.362 --> 00:09:07.831
OF LAW AND NEED TO ENFORCE IT.

00:09:07.832 --> 00:09:09.699
WHEN YOU SAID WELCOME, I SAID

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:11.634
I'M NOT SURE WHAT THAT MEANS.

00:09:11.635 --> 00:09:13.403
WE ARE A WELCOMING COUNTRY AND

00:09:13.404 --> 00:09:14.871
WE CAN VET EACH AND EVERY

00:09:14.872 --> 00:09:18.675
INDIVIDUAL TO GIVE US IN    IN T

00:09:18.676 --> 00:09:18.942
INDIVIDUAL TO GIVE US IN    IN E

00:09:18.943 --> 00:09:19.576
UNITED STATES OF AMERICA.

00:09:19.577 --> 00:09:20.310
&gt;&gt; THIS WAS AN IMPORTANT THING

00:09:20.311 --> 00:09:22.645
THAT WE LEARNED IN THE VERY

00:09:22.646 --> 00:09:23.213
BEGINNING.

00:09:23.214 --> 00:09:25.081
THIS WAS A HALF REPUBLICAN AND

00:09:25.082 --> 00:09:26.049
HALF DEMOCRAT GROUP.

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:27.851
ONLY ONE PERSON SAID THEY WANTED

00:09:27.852 --> 00:09:29.285
TO WELCOME THE CARAVAN.

00:09:29.286 --> 00:09:30.687
IT'S VERY INTERESTING, IT'S

00:09:30.688 --> 00:09:32.655
SIMILAR TO WHAT I FOUND ONE WE

00:09:32.656 --> 00:09:34.891
WERE IN TEXAS LAST WEEK.

00:09:34.892 --> 00:09:36.659
NOW AS YOU KNOW, PRESIDENT TRUMP

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:39.863
HAS MOVED OR VOWED TO MOVE

00:09:39.864 --> 00:09:40.864
